          "message": "The no-external-message test can miss a send invoked through reflection. Reject reflective invocation in the delivery call graph or otherwise make the test fail when a dynamically invoked external sender is added.",
          "confidence": 0.87,
          "category": "testing",
          "evidence": {
            "codePathTraced": "The external-send check walks direct IL method references and permits calls into System.Private.CoreLib. It does not inspect targets invoked dynamically through reflection.",
